{title: Baptize Me Jesus}
{key: Bb}

{comment: Chorus}
[Gm]Baptize me Jesus, with the Holy Ghost
[Gm]I shall have power, your word says so
[C]Satan is busy, trying to turn me around
[C]But I'm determined, to stand my ground
But I can't [Gm]do it, I can't [C]do it[Caug]
Bap[Gm]tize me [Em]with the [A]Holy [D]Ghost[Gm]

{comment: Verse 1}
[Gm]On the day of Pentecost
[Gm]They were all in one accord
[Gm]They were filled with expectation
[Gm]Waiting for the promise of the lord
[Gm]All of the sudden the Holy Ghost came
[Gm]Like a rushing mighty wind
{ci: (cut)}
And they were all filled with the Holy Ghost
{ci: (cut)}
So was the room they were sitting in

{comment: Verse 2}
[Gm]The people who were standing on the outside
[Gm]Were surprised by what was being done
[Gm]They marveled and said to one another
[Gm]Look, they're all speaking in another tongue
[Abm]Peter got up and started preaching
[Abm]He said repent and be baptized
{ci: (cut)}
He told everybody
{ci: (cut)}
Do it in the name of Jesus Christ

{comment: Bridge}
{ci: (repeat)}
[Abm]Baptize me Jesus with the Holy Ghost
{ci: (repeat)}
[Abm]I shall have [Db]power
{ci: (cut)}
Hang in [Abm]there, hang in there
[Gb]Don't [F]you  [Gb]dare  [D]give [Abm]up
